# Switch FS Crooked Grind: rolling tail first along the ledge with it on the toe side (the board's nose
# points back the way it came, the chest faces the ledge), popped off the nose (the nose button, Q, held as K is let go)
# into I + up + toward (left: the ledge is on the left of the way it travels): the crooked on the switch
# front truck, the board's back truck. Scored at tricks.stance.switch.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 270
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 3.6
hold ollie 60..90
hold nose 84..90
hold up 160..190
hold left 160..190
tap grind 165
bot balance
run 300
expect event pop{fakie=true,nose=true} within 91..91
expect event grindStart{trick=Switch FS Crooked Grind} within 120..200
expect no event bail
